  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Love.",
      "path": "audio/1965-25/01.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.779728
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "I am in bliss.",
      "path": "audio/1965-25/02.mp3",
      "start": 2.051678,
      "end": 3.320771
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "It was good that you met me in Bombay, my heart was overjoyed to see what is happening in you.",
      "path": "audio/1965-25/03.mp3",
      "start": 4.833152,
      "end": 9.936960999999998
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "This is how a person prepares and moves along the stairway towards truth.",
      "path": "audio/1965-25/04.mp3",
      "start": 11.401746000000001,
      "end": 15.521223999999998
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Life is a dual journey: one journey is in time and space the other is within oneself and truth.",
      "path": "audio/1965-25/05.mp3",
      "start": 17.066032,
      "end": 23.626417
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "The first ends in death the second in deathlessness.",
      "path": "audio/1965-25/06.mp3",
      "start": 25.155057,
      "end": 28.470635
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "The second is the real journey because it takes you somewhere.",
      "path": "audio/1965-25/07.mp3",
      "start": 30.023107,
      "end": 33.388366999999995
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Those who take the first journey as it, waste their lives.",
      "path": "audio/1965-25/08.mp3",
      "start": 34.877007000000006,
      "end": 38.437028999999995
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "The real life begins the day you start the other journey.",
      "path": "audio/1965-25/09.mp3",
      "start": 39.949773,
      "end": 43.03483
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "A really good beginning has taken place in your consciousness and I am filled with bliss to feel this.",
      "path": "audio/1965-25/10.mp3",
      "start": 44.641043,
      "end": 51.44
    }
  ]
}
